    "translation": "所有人",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addEnumSetting(\"TacticalTooltip_Values\", \"All\", [\"All\",\"AI Only\",\"Player Only\",\"None\"], \"Show Values\", \"Show Hitpoints, Armor etc. as values instead of immersive words.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440512,
    "key": "e30fbf9aa3744aef85ba6bc08360ecf58279960a28b3fb1e51894ad9878d20e3",
    "original": "All Ingredients Available",
    "translation": "拥有所有原料",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addEnumSetting(\"CraftingBlueprintVisibility\", \"One Ingredient Available\", [\"Always\",\"One Ingredient Available\",\"All Ingredients Available\",\"Vanilla\"], \"Blueprints Visible When\", \"Crafting Recipes in the Taxidermist will be displayed when this condition is met.\nNote that individual Blueprints (like Snake Oil) may still have custom rules preventing them from being shown.\n\n'Vanilla' means that the visibility behavior is unchanged from how it works in the base game.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440513,
    "key": "5d847628b7196522c5c2ff08b83498b9e911203542618bf9fdd92e2e668baf21",
    "original": "Allows you to save some time by skipping to a certain screen when opening a contract in settlements.\n\nDisabled: Same behavior as vanilla, you have to click through all of the contract's screens.\n\nNegotiation: Skip the introduction screens and go straight to the negotiation.\n\nOverview: Skip to the final screen in the contract where you can accept or reject it. With this option, you will no longer be able to manually negotiate contracts.",
    "translation": "使你可以在打开定居点的合同时跳过一些特定界面，节省一些时间。\n\n禁用：和原版行为一致，你需要点击推进合同流程的每个界面。\n\n谈判：跳过剧情导入界面直接进入谈判。\n\n概览：直接跳到最后选择接受或拒绝合同界面。选择此项时，你将无法手动进行合同谈判。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440514,
    "key": "de9f057a471cdb8d3b082719bdc7ad2031788d042947349723fa83c9d13a517a",
    "original": "Always",
    "translation": "总是",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addEnumSetting(\"CraftingBlueprintVisibility\", \"One Ingredient Available\", [\"Always\",\"One Ingredient Available\",\"All Ingredients Available\",\"Vanilla\"], \"Blueprints Visible When\", \"Crafting Recipes in the Taxidermist will be displayed when this condition is met.\nNote that individual Blueprints (like Snake Oil) may still have custom rules preventing them from being shown.\n\n'Vanilla' means that the visibility behavior is unchanged from how it works in the base game.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440515,
    "key": "d12eb47886fe7373a5d269af6b6cd2c0a70fc5b2a2064d938652f04f8540d7b0",
    "original": "Auto-Negotiate Attempts",
    "translation": "自动尝试谈判"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440516,
    "key": "30ef051710daa2487559b252387e6f616abb464dcc4d926c884e939fab4081be",
    "original": "Blueprints Visible When",
    "translation": "何时展示配方",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addEnumSetting(\"CraftingBlueprintVisibility\", \"One Ingredient Available\", [\"Always\",\"One Ingredient Available\",\"All Ingredients Available\",\"Vanilla\"], \"Blueprints Visible When\", \"Crafting Recipes in the Taxidermist will be displayed when this condition is met.\nNote that individual Blueprints (like Snake Oil) may still have custom rules preventing them from being shown.\n\n'Vanilla' means that the visibility behavior is unchanged from how it works in the base game.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440517,
    "key": "e7de98b13b6c41b8937ebca30fd811fee38c5a03c11c3b298eb6a840f3ebcfa0",
    "original": "Character Screen",
    "translation": "角色界面",
    "context": "getroottable().Reforged.Mod.ModSettings.addPage(\"Character Screen\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440518,
    "key": "9f42c55cbccec430abebaa0f1f64fb237bca837eee331871567d112b6a0d7c27",
    "original": "Characters in Combat",
    "translation": "战斗中的角色"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440519,
    "key": "82b5eb44877393ba260d1d393b282a6cd859d3e0bdd21529c4a34405752c4391",
    "original": "Collapse Actives When",
    "translation": "精简显示主动技能时机",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addRangeSetting(\"CollapseActivesWhenX\", 5, 0, 20, 1, \"Collapse Actives When\", \"While the number of active skills is below this value they display their icon and use a separate line. Otherwise they combine into a single block of text in order to save space.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440520,
    "key": "1ea201a0e7fbd86acaf052c474126805dc01bbf9854b1a779985f1bddc7ec240",
    "original": "Collapse Effects When",
    "translation": "精简显示效果时机",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addRangeSetting(\"CollapseEffectsWhenX\", 5, 0, 20, 1, \"Collapse Effects When\", \"While the number of effects is below this value all effects display their icon and use a separate line. Otherwise they combine into a single block of text in order to save space.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440521,
    "key": "c1cbcd734a6c2bbf1d9f4b98339b35a2bf18d3244ca9aac5b95c5c78128486d1",
    "original": "Collapse Hitchance Threshold",
    "translation": "折叠命中率阈值"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440522,
    "key": "4487397280691346dbeb227abb4dca1dc5b6fa50bcfa66d0b3f8d848663dbc2d",
    "original": "Collapse Perks When",
    "translation": "精简显示特技时机",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addRangeSetting(\"CollapsePerksWhenX\", 5, 0, 20, 1, \"Collapse Perks When\", \"While the number of perks is below this value all perks display their icon and use a separate line. Otherwise they combine into a single block of text in order to save space.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440523,
    "key": "cf3125fc9ee120daf30452d92a7cbd27f9218e3f8652a946e9c2acf6e32bf37d",
    "original": "Collapse as Text",
    "translation": "精简显示为文本",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addBooleanSetting(\"TacticalTooltip_CollapseAsText\", False, \"Collapse as Text\", \"If enabled, then skills collapse using their names as text, otherwise they collapse using their icons.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440524,
    "key": "b91435a2e3e0d0512d214d6fccaccef4e1809d91e4242b73680e33e99f4a9553",
    "original": "Confirm Skill Use",
    "translation": "确认技能使用",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addBooleanSetting(\"ConfirmSkillUse\", False, \"Confirm Skill Use\", \"If enabled, skills that are normally used immediately (e.g. Shieldwall, Rally) will instead require you to target your character. This allows you to preview Action Point and Fatigue costs and the predicted affordability of other skills. Hold the 'Confirm Skill Use' key (default Ctrl) to bypass this and use the skill immediately.\n\nIf disabled, these skills are used immediately as in vanilla, but the keybind can be used to preview them and require confirmation.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440525,
    "key": "0488acc63d8b513587cc45e2d7dd7c17cb873266452b23273c6dedb651764243",
    "original": "Contracts",
    "translation": "合同"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440526,
    "key": "d8ff18a3def6ffa067dcc9911fe7c8abaa89445974c0435aab7be484e04cc1c3",
    "original": "Crafting Recipes in the Taxidermist will be displayed when this condition is met.\nNote that individual Blueprints (like Snake Oil) may still have custom rules preventing them from being shown.\n\n'Vanilla' means that the visibility behavior is unchanged from how it works in the base game.",
    "translation": "剥制师处的制造配方会在符合设定条件时显示出来。\n请注意，一些个别配方（如蛇油）仍会受其特殊规则限制而不会展示。\n\n“原版”意味着其显示行为会和原版游戏相同。",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addEnumSetting(\"CraftingBlueprintVisibility\", \"One Ingredient Available\", [\"Always\",\"One Ingredient Available\",\"All Ingredients Available\",\"Vanilla\"], \"Blueprints Visible When\", \"Crafting Recipes in the Taxidermist will be displayed when this condition is met.\nNote that individual Blueprints (like Snake Oil) may still have custom rules preventing them from being shown.\n\n'Vanilla' means that the visibility behavior is unchanged from how it works in the base game.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440527,
    "key": "1a03bd2fd107c453f3183e30b9716f82200671e8270fbbefbe602f5a48705527",
    "original": "Debug",
    "translation": "除错及开发"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440528,
    "key": "dd5f2966532cabf8f975293f5d91aebb1c7a4fbd2f1d0eef711afaa5d4883b70",
    "original": "Debug & Dev",
    "translation": "除错及开发",
    "context": "getroottable().Reforged.Mod.ModSettings.addPage(\"Debug & Dev\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440529,
    "key": "072945610d450a86763af620a4c010b780b15016ec6e830aba774c94f6674957",
    "original": "Dev Options",
    "translation": "开发选项",
    "context": "debugPage.addTitle(\"Title_DevOptions\", \"Dev Options\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440530,
    "key": "75081b593d15cf6e631971bc6768723f593b88b172477e40ae7d363e4829816d",
    "original": "Disabled",
    "translation": "禁用"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440531,
    "key": "b247c7ad8d2a6b2236c6f5b1c7299d463991935c9cd9c98d5eac2eaccdcc6dd0",
    "original": "During movement preview, opponents with predicted hitchance equal to this or less are collapsed into a single tooltip entry.",
    "translation": "进行移动预览时，预测命中率小于等于此概率的敌人会在提示栏中被折叠为一行显示。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440532,
    "key": "632d94c6c579d80fbe700c8a48b7e106a0ada18f12f82678f3e8e30cee910656",
    "original": "During movement preview, show predicted chance to hit and to be hit based on the hovered tile.",
    "translation": "进行移动预览时，显示移动到鼠标悬停地格后的命中和被命中概率。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440533,
    "key": "26f0663bde205c930ad83863c2082dd5a2c12f66b598d4eb7d707f9e4db1c5d2",
    "original": "Enable display of various information about spawns on the world map such as party cost/strength, spawn day etc.",
    "translation": "若勾选，启用世界地图上一系列关于队伍战力、生成天数的各类信息。",
    "context": "debugPage.addBooleanSetting(\"Dev_SpawnsInfo\", False, \"Spawns Info\", \"Enable display of various information about spawns on the world map such as party cost/strength, spawn day etc.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440534,
    "key": "e43ccb60134b5b7bd47409f0a1bcf8253788bfb8c2d070f7396a0feaf3bb3a3c",
    "original": "Enable for debug logging of AIAgentFixes module",
    "translation": "启用AIAgentFixes模块的除错日志",
    "context": "debugPage.addBooleanSetting(\"Debug_AIAgentFixes\", False, \"AIAgentFixes\", \"Enable for debug logging of AIAgentFixes module\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440535,
    "key": "6490d5c57705cd1bd57049e973fb05d1da88d19d08918ab94b2c9c95156de88c",
    "original": "Enable for debug logging of onAnySkillExecutedFully module",
    "translation": "启用onAnySkillExecutedFully模块的除错日志",
    "context": "debugPage.addBooleanSetting(\"Debug_onAnySkillExecutedFully\", True, \"onAnySkillExecutedFully\", \"Enable for debug logging of onAnySkillExecutedFully module\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440536,
    "key": "c910d474dcd724bff83ddedeb06bf1eceaf9fb3af7c76bb282be057f36e6dffa",
    "original": "General",
    "translation": "将军"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440537,
    "key": "aeca20d000cf2367426f2ded169d7f00313124c216260f1eec396eb3dfdb4163",
    "original": "If enabled, skills that are normally used immediately (e.g. Shieldwall, Rally) will instead require you to target your character. This allows you to preview Action Point and Fatigue costs and the predicted affordability of other skills. Hold the 'Confirm Skill Use' key (default Ctrl) to bypass this and use the skill immediately.\n\nIf disabled, these skills are used immediately as in vanilla, but the keybind can be used to preview them and require confirmation.",
    "translation": "若勾选，一些点击后立即使用的技能（如盾墙、集结部队）会需要选择角色自己作为目标。这使你可以预览技能的行动点数和疲劳消耗，比较各个技能的使用收益。按住'确认使用技能'快捷键（默认为ctrl）来跳过这一步骤，直接使出技能。\n\n若反选，这些技能会像原版一样立即被使用，按住快捷键则会使使用技能需要确认，方便预览技能效果。",
    "context": "miscTooltipPage.addBooleanSetting(\"ConfirmSkillUse\", False, \"Confirm Skill Use\", \"If enabled, skills that are normally used immediately (e.g. Shieldwall, Rally) will instead require you to target your character. This allows you to preview Action Point and Fatigue costs and the predicted affordability of other skills. Hold the 'Confirm Skill Use' key (default Ctrl) to bypass this and use the skill immediately.\n\nIf disabled, these skills are used immediately as in vanilla, but the keybind can be used to preview them and require confirmation.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440538,
    "key": "09cdbc6dd17d719990e5fdbf6487c1aae1b8b692b5539a9a084a9a13efaa5576",
    "original": "If enabled, the character background tooltip will display projected attribute values, estimating how much each attribute could grow if all level-ups are invested into that attribute.",
    "translation": "若启用，角色的角色背景提示栏会显示预期的属性值，即你将每次属性升级都投入该项属性会得到的最终属性值。",
    "context": "characterScreenPage.addBooleanSetting(\"CharacterScreen_ShowAttributeProjection\", True, \"Show Attribute Projection\", \"If enabled, the character background tooltip will display projected attribute values, estimating how much each attribute could grow if all level-ups are invested into that attribute.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440539,
    "key": "4f254a31ac209ab6190f43be2d2f10cd4210aecbf76e737beabc12e5b91617f8",
    "original": "If enabled, the maximum and minimum Base Attribute Ranges for every background is displayed during Hiring, when hovering over the background icon.",
    "translation": "若启用，当你在雇佣界面将鼠标悬停在背景图标上时，会显示每个背景的基础属性最大和最小值。",
    "context": "characterScreenPage.addBooleanSetting(\"CharacterScreen_ShowBaseAttributeRangesHiring\", True, \"Show Base Attribute Ranges (Hiring)\", \"If enabled, the maximum and minimum Base Attribute Ranges for every background is displayed during Hiring, when hovering over the background icon.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440540,
    "key": "1f0b6a641e51b1f0ca4e43cbc8f18f003f877e9f3579c04451187065e783032a",
    "original": "If enabled, then skills collapse using their names as text, otherwise they collapse using their icons.",
    "translation": "若勾选此选项，精简显示会显示技能名称，反之则会显示图标。",
    "context": "tacticalTooltipPage.addBooleanSetting(\"TacticalTooltip_CollapseAsText\", False, \"Collapse as Text\", \"If enabled, then skills collapse using their names as text, otherwise they collapse using their icons.\")"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007440541,
    "key": "048cb0a340e5e54a7833ae8e933c5d7248fde422c92ec8ca5484cd1eeb2cc1c7",
